# a kit's character: FX's Character page on T1 shapes the whole kit (after its bus filter): PRESET picks the type,
# K1 too, the others its amount, tone and mix; a step held + FX: the lock pages reach it (SELECT from Sends to Character)
wait 300
expect trk 1
expect par1.ctype 0
tap FX
expect page Character
turn PRESET 1
expect par1.ctype 1
spin K2 10
expect par1.camt 74
spin K4 -27
expect par1.cmix 100
tapkey b1
wait 60
shot kit_character.png
tap PLAY
wait 400
tap PLAY
